# Keep archive-only and server-only material out of the Vercel upload.
# gitignore syntax. Written in Phase 1 of the frontend rebuild (docs/rebuild/STATUS.md).
# Rule: anything the shipped HTML/JS or api/ functions reference at runtime stays.
# Runtime references (verified by grep): the two current manual PDFs, docs/forms_official/,
# scripts/*.mjs loaded by pages, lib/, backend/data/enforcement/legal_rules.json (api/enforcement).

